      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明是继承了目白家传统的选手。\n她身为家族象征，若将她一路走来的\n这条路视为正道──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d84114356a88e48ccf70e3cc7d7cee1bf80576302e61b274b8cd7babb31077f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
